stereo-matplotlib (0.1.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The toolbar's "3D display settings..." runs kcmshell6 with KScreen's page (ORDER 50 step 5, continuation 2):
    libkf6kcmutils-bin (kcmshell6), kscreen (kcm_kscreen) and kde-cli-tools are Depends.
  * The toolbar starts kcmshell6 without QT_QPA_PLATFORM, so KScreen's page follows the desktop session: with the
    figure's Qt on xcb inside a Wayland session the page had asked for the X11 backend, which aborts.

